<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Bahebeleho</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda huli Bahebeleho</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bahebeleho</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda huli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bahebeleho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda huli Bahebeleho a hali na kele nduhi yi musonihi a nde ve. Nde a hali mu ulaha kaka huli na bali mu usonehe nde ve. Musonihi a nde abaambana na ikulu hi Bangeleke, ka nde li wu asinzatsikaha mabuuku ma Nzuhisini yi Kulu. Nde li mu usonehe huli Bamukristo ba bali peleve Bayudaayo. Bamukristo mo baana baamiikolo binama na baamiidimbasa lehemene na hiitu hya bo bya ŋa mbaandu. Bakima bali mu ukana utiimba tso imiinu hya bo. Musonihi a muhanda toondi ukuhasila ndongisili yi bo baayaki na ubwehwadisa bo.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="em">Mu nzila a Kristo</char>, wu Nzambi haatsindaha, <char style="em">baatu bali mu utuunga inoongi na Nzambi </char>(<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-2:18">1.1–2.18</ref></char>). Eye, Kristo li mwana a Nzambi, nde mbuli ali, bu Nzambi ali (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:3">1.3</ref></char>). Mu taangu mosi, nde amiikituha kaka muutu. Mu ukwa we muutu, nde amaasi matwala ma Livupu li Libi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 2:14">2.14</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu tooni a Kristo, banga imiinu utwala uyaasusaha huli Nzambi na hiitu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-5:10">3.1-5–5.10</ref></char>). Ni mu buuna, Yisu Kristo haamiito natee huli Nzambi, na Nzambi amiibyalisa nde mukuutu wu bangu ba bangaanga. Mu Nzuhisini yi Kulu, mukuutu wu bangaanga, ni nde wuuna wu utwala uyaasinzasusaha bebele na Nzambi, na ukoto hu mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi. Nde ubaatsuha bungodu mu uyaka nyahulili masumu. Bunuubu, Yisu Kristo, ndulu ni nde li mukuutu a bangaanga ba Nzambi. Muhanda huli Bahebeleho, ndulu ni nde siha li mu usilasa buuna ŋa hati li mihanda mya Nzuhisini yi Nyatihi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musonihi a muhanda li mu uvolo taangu mu ubindula buni Yisu ali mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wa banga imiinu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 5:11-10:31">5.11–10.31</ref></char>). Nde asobohono na bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi ba Bayudaayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu mumosi wa Nzuhisini yi Kulu li mu usaangula lo. Ni Libuuku la Mbandihili (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Mba 14.17-20</ref></char>) lili mu uyambila mu mbwanini a Abrahami na muutu, nga nduhi Melikisedeki. We Melikisedeki, Yisu ni mukuutu bangu ba bangaanga wu avelepala mu ibaandu hi bangaanga ba Nzambi ba Nzambi haabyalisa mu Mikele mya Moose. Yisu a baabyalisi ngaanga a Nzambi hu tsina makesili na matumili ma baatu ve. Bangaanga ba Nzambi bali ba balahi na bo bubaakwa. <char style="em">Ka Yisu Kristo ni mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wa nzyeni na nde li moonyi mu nzyeni. </char> Nde amiikoto hu yulu, hu Nzambi ali. Ni huuna, nde ali mu ubita bisu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu nzuhisini ya hati a tsomi, bangaanga ba Nzambi baakafutahala bungodu ndulu ni bwo ni bwo mu uyaka nyahulili masumu huli Nzambi. Mu ukuhasa nyahulili masumu, bo baakaduba bibulu. Ka Kristo aviidi muvumu a nde nzyeni ndulu mu va limosi. Bunuubu, Bamukristo bali mu udyata mu nzila yi nyatihi na bo a buufutahala mbisa ve.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="em">Imiinu hi bakaaha </char> aka <char style="em">ifwaani huli banga imiinu</char>. Ifwaani mo hiniihi hili mu uhwadisa bo mu ubaabiingala mapasi na mabaku ma lolo yiniiyi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:13">11.1–12.13</ref></char>). Ubaandiha mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 12:14">12.14</ref></char>, tsukusu a muhanda yili mu ubaangula buni Bamukristo buutwala ubaadyata na Nzambi, na uba itwadi na bakima na utuunga libundu la mbuli.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi miiyambila huli bisu mu munywa a Mwana a nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Hu tsikulu, Nzambi ayambili huli bakaaha ba bisu mu mana ma malahi na mu biyambilili bya pila mu pila, mu minywa mi mimbihuli. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Ka mu mataangu ma tsyelele maniima, Nzambi li mu uyambila huli bisu mu munywa a Mwana a nde. Ni mu nde Nzambi haavaangi tsi yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:3">Yow 1.3</ref></char></note>, na amiisoolo nde mubyalili a mukobe woosi. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Mwana mo li mu umwedeme mu muyusu a Nzambi. Nde li ifwaani hi hili mu umweese bu Nzambi ali. Nde li mu usika bisiha byosi bi Nzambi haavaanga mu mambu ma munywa a nde, ma maaluula mu matwala. Hu mbisa a hu nde haatsyemisi masumu ma baatu, Mwana mo amiiyatsahala hu mayulu, ŋa mbahala a Nzambi, Nga matwala moosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana a Nzambi akulala bapofi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Mwana na biita li laalutahala li bapofi. Mu tooni a biita mo liina, Nzambi haava nde nduhi yi yaalutahala biita na yi bapofi. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Mu mbuli, huli ki pofi Nzambi haaleele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«We ni Mwana a me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">me miimbyalisa we lolo yiniiyi?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Na huli ki pofi Nzambi haaleele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Me umba huli nde, Taata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">na nde uba huli me, Mwana<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mkg 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sa 7.14</ref></char></note>?»<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Ka mu taangu yi Nzambi ali mu utsindaha Mwana a nde watsomi ŋa toto, nde aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">«Bapofi ba Nzambi boosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:6">baafwana ukongemene mu ukuunda nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Pfu 32.43</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:7">Mkg 96.7</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Mu li litali bapofi, Nzambi aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">«Me ndi mu utsalila bapofi ba me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">we bu me ndi mu utsalila mavupu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">na basalili ba me, we maludi ma mbaahu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Mkg 104.4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ka mu li litali Mwana, nde li mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">«Kiti-ipfumu hya we, Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">yaamiivangama mu bilima na bilima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Likaanda la we li utuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">lili likaanda li butsiitsa.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />We atondo butsiitsa, na we abelele bubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">ni mu buuna, Nzambi wu li Nzambi a we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">miibyalisa we mu isalu hya nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">mu uyitala we maadi ma musaangu ŋa yulu mutswe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">na miisoolo ndulu we, ka a batsyengi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:7-8">Mkg 45.7-8</ref></char></note> ba we ve.»<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Nde li mu uleele kaka ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">«Ni we, Pfumu, wu avaangi toto ŋa mbaandu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">mayulu mali mavaanga ma myoho mya we.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Biina byosi byudimbala, ka we, we li mu ukwilala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">Toto na yulu byusyehe we bikutu bi bikulu;<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />we upoto byo we iyunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">na buusobo byo we bu bubaasobo bikutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Ka we, we ukwilala wu avelesobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">na idiingu hya we a hili na tsukusu ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:26-28">Mkg 102.26-28</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Nzambi a haabila uleele huli mumosi mu bapofi ba nde ve ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">«Tsahala ŋa mbahala a me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">natee bu me ukitusa baboho ba we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">isuusili hya miilu mya we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Mu mbuli, bapofi bali ndulu mavupu ma mali mu usalila Nzambi: Nde li mu utsindaha bo mu uyakumbasa ba buuyaka mukobe liyobolo.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Liyobolo li laafulala bunene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ni mu buuna, bisu laafwana usinzakangama mu ndongisili yi bisu laayuhi, mana bisu liveledunga. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Mu tooni ati, tsaangu yi bapofi baabehili bisu hu tsikulu, yimiimweese tsoongo a yo. Na pasi nde wu apenyi yo, buuve wu avelisiingala yo, ayaki tsyembili yi yaahwama na nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:53">Mav 7.53</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Buuna, buni bisu mwakulu luutwala upeke tsyembili, tso bisu lipenyi liyobolo la pila mo yiniiyi? Pfumu nde mwakulu ateehili uyabisa lo, titswene ba baayuhi Pfumu, baasilisi bisu tsoongo a lo. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Nzila mosi, Nzambi asilisi imbangi hya bo mu biliimbu bya kimuhili na bimangu na bipadi bya pila mu pila, naapa mu bungodu bu Livupu la Ngidi li nde haakabili we bu hu li litondo la nde.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nde wuuna wu li mu ubita baatu hu liyobolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Nzambi a haasuusi tsi yi yuuya, yi lili mu uyambila mu yo, hu tsina lituma li bapofi ve. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Mu mbuli, mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, muutu mumosi atiidi imbangi mo hiniihi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">«Muutu hima ali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">mana we yibuhala moonyi mu nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">mwana a muutu hima ali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">mana we taasila nde?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />We akulimisi nde hoole hu tsina bapofi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">we afuungili nde mu muyusu na mu likiinzu,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />we asuusi bisiha byosi hu tsina lituma la nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:5-7">Mkg 8.5-7</ref></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Tso Nzambi asuusi bisiha byosi hu tsina lituma la nde, mbindulili ti nde a haasiisi isiha tso imosi hi hyaavele hu tsina lituma la nde ve. Ka bunuubu, bisu kini a laamaamono ti bisiha byosi biba hu tsina lituma la muutu ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:5-7">Mkg 8.5-7</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Ka ma bisu lili mu umono ni maniima: Yisu baakulimisi hoole hu tsina lituma li bapofi, mana mu hyese hya Nzambi, nde akwa mu tooni a baatu boosi. Na bunuubu, bisu lili mu umono nde baafuungala mu muyusu na mu likiinzu, mu tooni lipfu li nde haamoni pasi. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Mu mbuli, hwaba hwayelemene ti Nzambi, muvaangi na mukeelisi bisiha byosi, asyenolo Yisu hu kuhisili mu nzila yi mapasi. Mana baana ba balahi bakoto mu muyusu a nde. Mu tooni ati, Yisu ni watsomi mu ubita bo hu liyobolo. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Ka Yisu wu ubaatsyemese masumu ma baatu boosi, na boosi ba bamiitsyeme, bali na Taata mumosi. Ni mu buuna, Yisu a hali na tsonyi mu uteele bo baana ba ngu a nde na bakedi ba nde ve. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Mu mbuli, nde li mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">«Nzambi a me, me toondi uyabisa nduhi a we</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">huli baana ba ngu na bakedi ba me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">me toondi uyuusa we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">ŋa kuungi la baatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:23">Mkg 22.23</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Nde abweleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">«Me utsa hiitu hya me mu Nzambi.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Titswene:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">«Me ndyowunuuwu, na baana ba Nzambi haava me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Esa 8.17-18</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Ka bu baana mo bali bivaangu bi musunya na bi makila, Yisu nde mwakulu miikituha we bo. Nde adyati itwadi na bo, mana mu lipfu la nde, nde atwala uhesolo Saatana wu akaanga matwala ma lipfu, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />na uyobolo boosi ba boomo bu lipfu bwakakitusa we baviha mu idiingu hya bo hyoosi. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Mu mbuli, a mu uyaakumbasa bapofi ve, ka mu uyaakumbasa imbisa hya Abrahami<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8-9">Esa 41.8-9</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ni mu buuna, hwafwani ti nde akituha ifwafwani hya baana ba ngu na bakedi ba nde, mana nde aba mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi a bo, wu aluula mu kwili lingebe na wa ngetetee mu isalu hya Nzambi, mu tooni ufwinzala masumu ma baatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:20">Lev 4.20</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 4:26">26</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 4:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:6">16.6</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 16:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 16:11">11</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Na bunuubu, nde utwala ufuuhasa baatu ba bali mu uyebe, mu tooni ati, nde mwakulu avyohili mu iteesi hya nzyebili na hi mapasi.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu akulala Moose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Ni mu buuna, baana ba ngu, benu ba lili bangidi ba Nzambi, benu lili na kabu la teelili yi yili mu umata hu mayulu. Buuna, talaani Yisu, iluumbi hya Nzambi na mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wu imiinu hi bisu lili mu uta ibila. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Nde aba ngetetee mu Nzambi wu abyalisi nde, we bu baabyalisi Moose mu utuma nzo a nde yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Mat 12.7</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Bunuubu, muyusu wu li na Yisu, afulala wa Moose bunene. Mu tooni ati, wu ubaatuunga nzo, afulala nzo yo mwakulu muyusu. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />A hu li na nzo yi yaavele na mutuungi ve, ka wu atuunga bisiha byosi ni Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Mu li litali Moose, nde aba ngetetee mu utuma nzo a Nzambi yoosi, bu nde haaba musalili wu uta imbangi mu ma Nzambi haakiibaaleele. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ka Kristo, nde li ngetetee bu nde ali Mwana wu baasuusa mu utuma nzo a Nzambi. Na bisu ni nzo a nde, tso bisu likeelisi imiinu na hiitu bi bisu lili na nyeme mu byo.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi li mu uva puumili huli ba bubaayuhala nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ni mu buuna, we bu Livupu la Ngidi lili mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">«Lolo yiniiyi, tso benu liyuhi ndaha a Nzambi,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />a lisa mitima mya benu ngototoo ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">we bu benu laatuumbihili nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">mu ilumbu hi benu laayebi nde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">hu kumu a nzala.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Huuna, bakaaha ba benu baamesi me na baayebi me, buleeli Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:9">tso hu mbisa umono moosi ma me apaangi<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />mu maku mana ma bilima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">Ni mu buuna, me akwili tuungi mo liina kesi, na me andeeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">“Mitima mya bo mili mu udunga taangu yoosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">na bo a baatoondi utsikaha manzila ma me ve.”<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Hutso a kesi a me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">me andabi mulabu mo wunuuwu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">Bo a buubila ukoto hu puumili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">yi me amiipaangila bo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:21">Mat 14.21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Mkg 95.7-11</ref> </char></note>!»<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Baana baa ngu, kebaani, mana muutu ŋa hati la benu aveleba na mutima ngototoo, wu avele na imiinu, wu li mu ubita nde mu umiinguha Nzambi a moonyi. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Ka baahwadasanaani pasi ilumbu, mu mataangu moosi ma buutwala uleele «lolo yiniiyi», mana tso mumosi mu benu a haba na mutima ngototoo, na a habwa mu soho li lisumu. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Mu mbuli, bisu lili batsyengi ba Kristo, tso bisu likeelisi na mifudi natee hu tsukusu, hiitu hi bisu laabahi ŋa mbaandu.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Buuna, baaleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">«Lolo yiniiyi, tso benu liyuhi ndaha a Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">a lisa mitima mya benu ngototoo ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">we bu benu laatuumbihili nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Mkg 95.7-8</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Ka, bana baayuhi ndaha a Nzambi na baatuumbihili nde? Ni boosi ba Moose haapalisi mu Ngipiti. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Huli baana Nzambi haakwili kesi mu maku mana ma bilima? Ni huli ba baasumihi na ba baakwidi mu kumu a nzala. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Ŋa Nzambi haalabi mulabu mo wunuuwu: «Bo a buubila ukoto hu puumili yi me amiipaangila bo ve», huli baana nde haalabi nde? Huli ba baatuumbihili nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Mat 14.1-35</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:11">Mkg 95.11</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Mu mbuli, bisu lili mu umono ti bo a baatwali ukoto hu puumili mo yiina ve, mu tooni ati, bo baabisi usa imiinu.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Buuna, bu lahi li Nzambi haamiisiisala mu ukoto hu puumili a nde likini, likebaani, mana tso mumosi mu benu a haba na tooni yi usaala mbisa. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Mu mbuli, bisu laayaki tsaangu yimbwe, bumosi kaka we ba baabeedi hu kumu a nzala. Ka tsaangu yi bo baayuhi, a yaabuti kaluha ve. Ka bu bo baayuhi yo, bo a baayuhi yo na imiinu ve. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Bisu baa lili mu usa imiinu, laaka mu ukoto hu puumili mo yiina yi Nzambi haaleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">«Hutso a kesi a me, me andabi mulabu mo wunuuwu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">Bo a buubila ukoto hu puumili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">yi me amiipaangila bo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Mkg 95.11</ref> </char></note>!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Nzambi haaleeli lo, bu isalu hya nde hyaaba hyaamiifwa umata pangili a tsi. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Ni mu buuna, baasonehe bunuubu mu Libuuku la Ngidi mu tooni ilumbu hya tsambu: «Nzambi avuumi mu ilumbu hya tsambu, bu haamani isalu hya nde hyoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Mba 2.2</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Tsyelo kima kaka baabwesonehe: «Bo a buubila ukoto hu puumili yi me amiipaangila bo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Mkg 95.11</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Baatu ba tsikulu ba baayuhi Mambu ma Nzambi, a baakoti hu puumili mo yiina ve, mu tooni ati bo baasiidi kene. Buuna, hukini na muswa huli baatu bakima mu ukoto huuna. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi amiibwekese ilumbu ikima hi bali mu uteele «lolo yiniiyi». Nde amatoyo mu hyo umata beleve mu munywa a Davidi, mu mambu ma baamiikwasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">«Tso benu liyuhi ndaha a Nzambi lolo yiniiyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">a lisa mitima mya benu ngototoo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Mkg 95.7-8</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Mu mbuli, ubaamono ti Yosuwa atoosi buli li Isereli hu puumili mo yiina<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Pfu 31.7</ref></char></note>, Nzambi a haakiibweyambila mu ilumbu ikima hu mbisa ve. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Ni mu buuna, hukini na puumili kima huli baatu ba Nzambi, yi yafwanina na yi ilumbu hya tsambu. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Mu mbuli, woosi wu miikoto hu puumili yi Nzambi haamiivangimasa, miivuuma mu isalu hya nde, we bu Nzambi haavuumi mu hya nde. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Ni mu buuna, lihwadaani mu ukoto hu puumili mo yiina, mana muutu tso mumosi avelebwa mu tooni a kene, we bu hwasiidi bakaaha ba bisu. <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Mu mbuli, mambu ma Nzambi mali moonyi na mifudi. Mo maafulala tso mbeedi a suungu mu uto. Mo mu baakotelele natee hu ukahula muvumu na iluunzi, makede na busoho. Mo mu baatsundasa makani na matsimi ma mutima a muutu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />A hu li na ivangu tso imosi hi hyutwala uswemene Nzambi ve. Ŋa miisu mya nde, byosi byamonehele paayalala, huli nde wuuna wu bisu boosi laafwana uva ikuumbu.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ni mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi nga bunyanga bu utuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Ni mu buuna, likaangaani mu mifudi, imiinu hi libaataani ibila! Mu tooni ati, bisu lili na mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi nga bunyanga bu utuma, wu amiito natee ŋa busu bwa Nzambi: ni Yisu, Mwana a Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Bisu lili na mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wu ubaamono pasi mu ikolili hya bisu. Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wa bisu, baayebi mu moosi we bu bisu lili, ka nde a haasiidi lisumu ve.<verse eid="HEB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Lisusahaani na hiitu ŋa pedu a kiti-ipfumu hya Nzambi, hu hyese hili mu usasa. Huuna, bisu luuyaka kwili lingebe na hyese, mu uyobolo bisu mu taangu yi yaafwana.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Pasi mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi baasoolo ŋa hati la baatu. Isalu hya nde ni usalila Nzambi mu tooni libwe la baatu. Nde ubaava makabu na bungodu bwa tsuhili mu masumu ma baatu. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Bu nde haateleme nde mwakulu mu iteesi hi musunya wu akolo, nde utwala umweese kwili lingebe huli ba baavele na nzaabili na huli ba baadunga. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Mu tooni a bu nde ali nde mwakulu mu iteesi hi musunya wu akolo, nde afwana ubaava bungodu bwa tsuhili ndulu a mu tooni masumu ma baatu ve, ka naapa mu tooni masumu ma nde mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lev 9.7</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Muutu utwala ubinuha butsitu bu uba mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi ve. Ubaayaka bwo ndulu mu teelili a Nzambi, we bu hwaba teelili a Aroni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Kristo kaka a haabinuhi nde mwakulu muyusu wu uba mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi ve. Nde ayaki butsitu mo buuna huli Nzambi, wu atiili nde ibila we bu baasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">«We ni wu li Mwana a me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">lolo yiniiyi, me Taata a we».<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Tsyelo kima baabweleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">«We li ngaanga a Nzambi wa taangu yoosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">mu mulongo mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi Melekisedeki<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mkg 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 110:4">110.4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Ni mu buuna, mu idiingu hya nde ŋa toto, Yisu asiidi masambulu na miyayiini hutso bileele bi binene na matsanga, huli Nzambi wu akiitwala uyobolo nde mu lipfu. Na Nzambi ayuhili nde, mu tooni a kulimini a nde. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Tso bu nde haaba Mwana a Nzambi, nde ayihi lisiingala mu mapasi moosi ma nde haamoni. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Buuna, Nzambi asiidi nde wu asupaha. Nde amiikituha mutswe a nzali wu liyobolo li bilima na bilima huli baatu boosi ba bubaasiingala nde. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Mu mbuli, Nzambi abyalisi nde mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi mu mulongo mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hu li na tsisu mu utiimba imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Bisu lili na mambu ma malahi ma uleele mu musamu mo wunuuwu, ka hu li na pasi mu ubindula benu mo, mu tooni ati, benu laaleme mu utsikaha mambu. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Benu kini laaka milongisi umata beleve. Ka benu likini na nzala ati balongese benu ndongisili ya mbaandu yi musamu a Nzambi! Benu likini na nzala mabeelo ŋa mbuha a byudya bi byaayele. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Wu ubaanywa mabeelo li ndulu mwana a ngebe, nde a hali na nzaabili tso hoole mu utsikaha mambu ma butsiitsa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1Ko 3.2</ref></char></note> ve. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ka byudya bi byaayele byayelemene na baatu ba baakula. Baatu mo baniiba, mu tsalili a bo, bali na hyuku hi usa lisobosono ŋa hati la lilibwe na li libi.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Ni mu buuna, likinguhaani hu ndongisili yi yaayele, mu utiimba mandongisili ma mbaandu ma bukristo ma laayuhi. Bisu a luubwefutahala ndongisili ya mbaandu yiniiyi ve: tsoongo yi usiisa mavaanga ma mabi ma mu baabita hu lipfu, na yi usa imiinu mu Nzambi, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />ndongisili yi yaatala tondihili, ya tsuusili a myoho, tsuuhili a mu babaakwa, na tsundusu yi bilima na bilima. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Ni buuna, bisu a benu laafwana usa, tso Nzambi viidi muswa.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Ka uto ti ba baayaki liyalala la Nzambi, ba baabiimbi bungodu bwa hu yulu na baayaki Livupu la Ngidi, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />ba baabiimbi mambu ma mabwe ma Nzambi, na matwala ma tsi yi yiuya, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />na ba baamiifutahala mu ndyatili a bo yi kulu, utwala ubila ubwebita bo hu usobo mbiili ve. Ka mu libwe la bo mwakulu, bo baaka mu ubwekomene Mwana a Nzambi ŋa kuruwa, na ubwenyanza nde ŋa kuungi la baatu mu bituhi.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa toto yimiisinzayaka mamba ma mvula, wu ubaanoho taangu yoosi, na yimiipalisa mimbutu mya tsoongo huli bo baana ba bamiikuna myo, Nzambi li mu usyeme yo. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ka tso yo yili mu upalisa masaangi ma matsyende na bifuundi, yo a yili na tsoongo ve. Nzambi a huutaamba mu usinga yo, na utsuha yo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Mba 3.17-18</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ka tso bisu lili mu utoyo buuna bambaahi baa litondo, bisu lili na hiitu ti benu mu nzila yimbwe lili, ni nzila yi liyobolo. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi li wa tsiitsa! Nde a huuvusahana isalu hya benu ve, tso litondo li benu laamweesi mu tooni a nduhi a nde, mu likumbasa li benu laasiidi na likini mu usa huli bangidi bakima. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Ka bisu lili na nzala ati, pasi muutu mu benu amweese lehemene mo liina kaka natee hu tsukusu, mana hiitu hya benu hiba hi hyakuha. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Ni mu buuna, a likituha babolo mu utsikaha ve, ka volwaani ifwaani hya baatu ba bali mu usa imiinu na mukami, mana bayaka mukobe wu Nzambi haamiisiila bo lahi.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lahi la Nzambi utwala usobo ve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Ŋa Nzambi haasiidi lahi huli Abrahami, nde alabi mulabu mu nduhi a nde mwakulu, mu tooni ati, a hwaba na muutu wu akulala nde, wu nde huulabila mu nde ve. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Nde aleeli:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 6:14">«Mu mbuli, me utsyeme we hu hwafulala, na me upfunasa imbisa hya we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Mba 22.16-17</ref> </char></note>!» <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Abrahami asiidi mukami na ayaki byosi bi Nzambi haasili nde lahi. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Ka baatu bubaalaba mulabu mu nduhi a muutu wu akulala bo. Ni mu buuna, bo bubaasalila mulabu we iliimbu hi hibaasukasa paha. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Nzambi atoondi umweese bubwe-bubwe, huli ba baakiiyaka bi nde haasiidi lahi ti, kesili a nde a yaakiisobo ve, ni mu buuna, nde haalabi mulabu. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Buuna, hu li na makesili moole ma mu uvelesobo. Hutso makesili mo maana, Nzambi utwala upfuta ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Mat 23.19</ref></char></note>. Ni mu buuna, bisu baa laamiisoolo iswemili mu Nzambi, nde li mu uhwadisa bisu mu ukaanga na mifudi, hiitu hi nde haamiilahila bisu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Hiitu mo hiina, hili mu bisu we itali hi hibaakangimasa likuumbi, li idiingu hya bisu. Hyo hili hya tsiki na hi hyavangama. Hyo hibaakotelele nguumbu a mu nzo a Nzambi ya hu mayulu natee hu mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lev 16.2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Ni huuna, Yisu haakateehele bisu ukoto mu libwe la bisu, mu tooni ati, nde aka mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wu bilima na bilima, mu mulongo mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Melekisedeki, mutumi na ngaanga a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melekisedeki mo wunuuwu, abeedi mutumi a Salemi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mutumi a Salemi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbindulili ti mutumi a Yeruselemi buuve ti mutumi a hyenze.</char></note>, na ngaanga a Nzambi wa Nzambi a hu hati a yulu. Ŋa Abrahami haamati hu mudiingu wu nde haabiingili batumi, Melekisedeki ayabwana nde na asyemi nde. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Abrahami aviidi nde ikuuku imosi mu kuumi, hya byosi bi nde haavoli. Nduhi a Melekisedeki mbindulili a hati a tsomi ti: «mutumi a butsiitsa» titswene, nde abeedi mutumi a Salemi, mbindulili ti «mutumi a hyenze<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Mba 14.17-20</ref> </char></note>». <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />A baayaaba taata a nde, tso ngu a nde, tso kaaha a nde ve. Nde a hali na tso mbandihili bilumbu, na tso tsukusu idiingu ve. Bu bubaamono ti nde afwanina na Mwana a Nzambi, nde ukwilala ngaanga a Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14">Mba 14</ref></char></note> mu bilima na bilima.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Monwaani ki biita lilinene li nde ali na lo! Abrahami kaaha a bisu, aviidi nde ikuuku imosi mu kuumi hi bisiha bi nde haavoli huli ba nde haabiingili mudiingu. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Kaahu, ba imbisa hya Levi, ba bali bangaanga ba Nzambi, bali na muswa we bu hu li tumili Mikele, mu ubaavondo ikuuku imosi mu kuumi, huli buli li Isereli ba bali baana ba ngu ba bo ba tsi mosi, na ba baapala mu imbisa hya Abrahami<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Mat 18.21</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Melekisedeki a haabeedi wu imbisa hya Levi ve, ka nde abahi ikuuku imosi mu kuumi huli Abrahami, mu bi nde haabahi. Titswene, nde asyemi wu ayaki malahi ma Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Ka bisu utwala usa paha ve ti, muutu wu ubaasyeme, alutahala muutu wu bamiisyeme. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Ba imbisa hya Levi, bangaanga ba Nzambi baakayaka ikuuku imosi mu kuumi hya mu bisiha bya bo, bo bali baatu ba buukwa. Ka mu Melekisedeki, ikuuku mo hiina himiikinguha huli muutu wu li moonyi, we bu Mabasonehe mali mu usilasa lo. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Hu mbisa, utwala mu uleele ti, ŋa Abrahami haafuti ikuuku imosi mu kuumi hi bisiha bya nde, Levi kaka afuti byo, nde wu imbisa hya nde hibaayaka ikuuku imosi mu kuumi hya byosi. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Tso bu baaba kini a baabuti Levi ve, nde abeedi aka mutso makila ma kaaha a nde Abrahami ŋa Melekisedeki haayabwana Abrahami.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Mikele mi baaviidi huli buli li Isereli, myaaba myaasiingama ŋa yulu isalu hi bungaanga bwa Nzambi hya buli li Balevi. Tso isalu hi bo baakasa hyaaba hyakuha, kini a hwakiiba tsoongo ve ti, ngaanga a Nzambi wu lisobosono na batsomi, amonehele mu mulongo a Melekisedeki, ka a mu ikulu hya Aroni ve. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Tso isalu hi bungaanga a Nzambi himiisobo, Mikele kaka myaafwana usobo. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Na Pfumu a bisu, wu mambu mo maniima maahwama mu nde li wa buli likima, li pasi muutu kini a haasiidi isalu hi bungaanga a Nzambi ŋa diiku li bungodu ve. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Hwayabahana bubwe ti, Pfumu a bisu baabuti mu buli la Yuda, li Moose haavelileele dyambu tso limosi ŋa nde haatoyili mu bangaanga ba Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngaanga a Nzambi mukima wu mulongo a Melekisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Dyambu mo lili mu umweese paayalala ti: ngaanga a Nzambi mukima wu amonihili, afwanina na Melekisedeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Nde a haakituhi ngaanga a Nzambi we bu hu li matumili ma mabuli ma baatu ve. Ka nde akituhi ngaanga a Nzambi mu matwala ma moonyi wu avele na tsukusu. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Mu mbuli, Mabasonehe mali mu usilasa lo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">«We li ngaanga a Nzambi wa taangu yoosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">mu mulongo a Melekisedeki<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Mkg 110.4</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Eye, bubaafwinzala mukele a tsomi, mu tooni a bu nde haamiivolo, buuve bu tsoongo a nde yaamiifwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Mikele mya Moose a myaabehi pasi isiha hu usupaha ve. Ka bisu a benu laamiibaha hiitu hi hyafulala bubwe, na mu hyo, bisu lili mu ususaha ŋa pedu a Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Titswene, hu li na mulabu a Nzambi. Bakima baakituhi bangaanga ba Nzambi, hwavele na mulabu a pila mo yiina. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Ka Yisu, baabyalisi nde ngaanga a Nzambi hu tsina mulabu, ŋa Nzambi haaleeli nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">«Pfumu alabi mulabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">na nde a haasobi kesili a nde mwakulu ve:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“We li ngaanga a Nzambi wa taangu yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Mkg 110.4</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Ni mu buuna, Yisu ni muutu wuuna wu li kaka mutaasili a nzuhisini yi yaafulala bubwe.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Hu li na lisobosono likima: bangaanga ba Nzambi baaba ba balahi, mu tooni ati, lipfu laaba ikahu mu ukwilala mu isalu hya bo. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ka Yisu li moonyi taangu yoosi, na isalu hi bungaanga a Nzambi hya nde, hili hya taangu yoosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">taangu yoosi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">hi buuvelekaba huli muutu mukima.</char></note>! <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ni mu buuna, nde utwala uyobolo nzyeni baatu ba buususaha huli Nzambi mu nzila a nde. Mu tooni ati, nde li moonyi taangu yoosi mu ubaasambila Nzambi mu tooni a bo. <verse eid="HEB 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Yisu kaahu ni mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, wu bisu laaba na nde nzala. Wu avele na ipiha, wu avele na lisumu, baatahuli nde na banga masumu, na baasyenuli nde hu hati a yulu hu mayulu. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Nde a hali we bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi bakima ve: nde a hali na nzala ubaava bungodu pasi ilumbu ve, hati a tsomi mu masumu ma nde mwakulu, titswene, mu ma baatu. Nde aviidi bungodu mo buuna va limosi, ŋa nde haayehuli nyutu a nde mwakulu. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Mikele mya Moose mibaabyalisa bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, mu baatu ba baavelesupaha. Ka mulabu a Nzambi, wu nde haalabi ŋa mbisa Mikele, ubaabyalisa we mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, Mwana wu baasyenuli mu musupuhunu a nde wa taangu yoosi.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu ni mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wa bisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Ngu a dyambu mu mambu moosi ma bisu luuleele, ni wunuuwu: bisu lili na mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, nde wuuna wu atsahala hu mayulu, ŋa mbahala a kiti-ipfumu ya Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>, Nga matwala. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Nde li mu usa isalu hya nde hutso a mbuha a ngidi, ni nzo a ngooto ya mbuli, yi Pfumu haatelemese, ka a yi muutu haatelemese ve.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Buuna, pasi mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, bubaabyalisa mu isalu hi ubaava makabu na bungodu huli Nzambi. Ni mu buuna, wa bisu kaka mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, afwana ubaha kaka isiha hi uva. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Kini nde li ŋa toto ŋaniiŋa, nde a haakiiba tso ngaanga a Nzambi ve. Mu tooni ati, hwamiiteehele bakima ba bali mu uva makabu we bu hu li Mikele mya Moose. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Bikuundili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bikuundili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ukuhasa bisalili bi Bayudaayo mu uyuusa na ukuunda Nzambi.</char></note> bi bangaanga ba Nzambi mo baniiba, bili ndulu ifwaani, buuve inzinza hi bimbuli bi mayulu. Byo byayelemene na bu Nzambi haayibusi Moose mu tumili mo yiniiyi, ŋa nde haakiituunga nzo a ngooto ya ngidi: «We afwana usa moosi, mana isalu hya we hiyelemene na bituungili bi me amweesi we ŋa yulu isyelo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Pal 25.40</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ka bunuubu, Yisu li mu usa isalu hi hyalutahala isalu hi bangaanga ba Nzambi. Mu tooni ati, nde ni sabu la nzuhisini yi yaalutahala bubwe, yi yaatsahala ŋa yulu malahi ma maalutahala bubwe.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Tso mbuli nzuhisini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nzuhisini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nzuhisini yi baasiidi hu Sinayi.</char></note> yatsomi a yaaba na ipiha ve, a hwakiiba na tsoongo mu ukiisa yo mu ya moole ve. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ka Nzambi li mu usyembe baatu ba nde na uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">«Mu bilumbu bi byuya hu busu, huleeli Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">me ukuta nzuhisini yi nyatihi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">na bisu Isereli, na bisu Yuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Yo a yuuba we nzuhisini yi me akuti na bakaaha ba bo ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">mu ilumbu hi me apalisi bo, mu tsi a Ngipiti mu hooho hwa me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Bo a baabeedi ngetetee mu nzuhisini mo yiina ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ni mu buuna, me apelimbwemonele bo lingebe, buleeli Pfumu.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Ka mono buni nzuhisini yi me ukuta na bisu Isereli yuuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">hu mbisa bilumbu mo biina buleeli Pfumu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Me utsonehe matumili ma me mutso matsimi ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">me ukiratana mo mutso mitima mya bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">me umba Nzambi a bo, na bo buuba baatu ba me!<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Muutu tso mumosi a huubwebila ulongese wuna, buuve mwana a ngu a nde ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">na uleele: “Yaaba Pfumu!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Mu tooni ati, boosi buuyaaba me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">umata wu afulala bukenyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">natee wu afulala bukuutu.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Me utsa kolo-kolo mu ma mabi ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:12">na me a humbwenzibuhala moonyi mu masumu ma bo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yel 31.31-34</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Bu Nzambi haayambili mu nzuhisini yi nyatihi, nde miikitusa yatsomi yiba yi kulu. Ka hi ikulu na hi himiinuna, byaka bebele mu udimbala.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Bikuundili bya ŋa toto na bya hu yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Nzuhisini yatsomi yaabeedi na matumili ma bikuundili na mbuha ya ngidi ya ŋa toto. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Nzo a ngooto yi bibadi byole baatelimisi. Mu ibadi hyatsomi hi bubaateele «mbuha ya ngidi», hwaba na isuusili hya miinda, na meetse ma baasuusala mapa ma baayeholo huli Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Hu mbisa a nguumbu ya moole, hwaba na ibadi hi bubaateele «mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Pal 26.31-33</ref></char></note>». <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Huuna, hwaba na meetse ma baayolo mu wolo, hu baakatsuha paha a tsulu yimbwe, na kasu a nzuhisini yi baayolo mu wolo. Hutso a kasu mo yiina, hwaba na ikoombe hya mu wolo, hi hyaluula mu maane, likaanda la Aroni li laapalisi bifulu, na bibadi bi mamanya ma baaba baasonehe matumili ma nzuhisini<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:33">Pal 16.33</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">25.10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">30.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:16-26">Mat 17.16-26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Pfu 10.3-5</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Ŋa yulu a kasu, baavala bifwaani bi bakeluba ba muyusu. Posi mapapi ma bo, yaakafuha mbuha yi bubaayeholo makila mu linyahula li masumu ma baatu. Ka taangu kini a yaafwana mu uyambila mu mambu mo maana ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Pal 25.23-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">25.31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">26.1-30</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Bu baavangimisi bisiha mo biina byosi, bangaanga ba Nzambi buukaakoto taangu yoosi, mu ibadi hyatsomi hya nzo a ngooto, mu usa bikuundili bya bo. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ka ndulu mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi ukoto mu ibadi hya byole. Nde akakoto huuna, ndulu koto limosi mu ilima. Nde afwana ubita makila ma ibulu, ma nde huuyeholo huli Nzambi mu tooni masumu ma nde mwakulu, naapa mu ma baatu baavangi hutso budiimbu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Mat 18.2-6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Lev 16.2-34</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Ni mu buuna, Livupu la Ngidi lili mu umweese ti, nzila yi ukoto hu mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi kini a yaadibumi ve, bu ibadi hya nzo a ngooto hyatsomi hikini. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Yiina ni kuma a taangu mo yiniiyi. Yo yitoondi uleele ti, makabu na bungodu bwa tsuhili bibulu bu bubaava huli Nzambi, utwala uvudamasa matsimi ma muutu wu ubaasa bikuundili mo biina ve. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Maana ndulu matumili ma bumuutu, ma maakangama mu byudya, byunywa na matsalili mana moosi ma utsyemese nyutu. Matsalili mo maana, maaba na tsoongo ndulu mu mwana a taangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">taangu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yiina ni taangu ya nzuhisini yi nyatihi.</char></note>, natee bu Nzambi huubwesobo mambu moosi.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Ka Kristo amonihili na biita li mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, wu mabwe moosi maamiimonehele. Nde akoti hutso a nzo a ngooto yi yaalutahala tsoongo na usupaha, yi baaveletuunga mu myoho mya baatu, buuve yi yaavele ya tsi mo yiniiyi. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Ŋa Kristo haakoti ndulu koto limosi nzyeni hu mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi, nde a haayehuli makila ma balumi ba bataba, na ma balumi ba bangombe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">makila ma balumi ba bataba, na ma balumi ba bangombe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">makila ma balumi ba bataba na ma baana ba bangombe (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 16:18">Lev 16.18</ref></char>).</note> ve. Ka nde makila ma nde mwakulu haayehuli, na nde ayobili bisu mu masumu ma bisu mu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Makila ma balumi ba bataba na ma balumi ba bangombe, na mufutu wa mwana a ngombe wu baakudasa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:14-16">Lev 16.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Mat 19.9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note>, bi bubaapuupala ŋa yulu a baatu ba baasumaha, bibaatsyemese bo mu masumu ma bo. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Ka umono ti ni buuna, na ki pila mifudi mi myafulala, makila ma Kristo muubweba! Mu Livupu li bilima na bilima li laakasala mu nde, Kristo ayehuli nde mwakulu huli Nzambi hwavele ipiha, we bungodu bu bwasupaha. Makila ma nde muutsyemese matsimi ma bisu mu mavaanga ma mabi, mana bisu a benu likuundaani Nzambi a moonyi.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Ni mu buuna, Kristo ali sabu la nzuhisini yi nyatihi, mana ba Nzambi haamiiteele, bayaka mukobe wu bilima na bilima, wu nde haasa lahi huli baatu ba nde. Bo utwala uyaka nde, mu tooni a bu lipfu laamonihili, lipfu li limiiyobolo baatu mu masumu ma bo baasiidi mu nzuhisini yatsomi.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Ŋa hu li muhanda a nzuhisini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">muhanda a nzuhisini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">muhanda a mambu ma baafwana usalila ŋa mbisa lipfu la muutu wu miisonehe nde.</char></note>, hwafwana basilasa ti, musonihi muhanda mo wuuna miikwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Mu mbuli, muhanda a nzuhisini a hali na tsoongo ve, bu musonihi a nde akini moonyi. Nde huuba na tsoongo ndulu ŋa musonihi a nde amiikwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ni mu buuna, nzuhisini yatsomi kaka yaavelitswiha, hwavele puhimini makila. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Moose amayabisa huli baatu boosi matumili moosi, we bu baasonehe mo hutso libuuku li Mikele. Titswene, nde avoli makila ma baana ba bangombe na ma balumi ba bataba, na mamba. Nde asalili itabi hi muti a isopi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">isopi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mululumbu wu bubaakuna mu uhaha myumbu mu mala.</char></note> na myoso mi mibeenge, mu upuhala byo ŋa yulu libuuku li Mikele, na ŋa yulu a baatu boosi. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Nde aleeli bunuubu: «Maniima ni makila ma mali mu usilasa nzuhisini yi Nzambi haatumasa benu mu ukiinza<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:3-8">Pal 24.3-8</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Bumosi kaka, Moose atsaatsili makila ŋa yulu a nzo a ngooto, na mu bisiha byosi bi bo baakasalila mu bikuundili. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />We bu hu li Mikele, bisiha byosi baafwana utsyemese ndulu mu makila, na nyahulili masumu ubaayaka ndulu mu puhimini yi makila<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lev 8.15</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:11">17.11</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Tso ni buuna baafwana utsyemese bisiha bi bikuundili, bi bili bifwaani bya hu mayulu, bi bili hu mayulu na nzala bungodu bu bwalutahala tsoongo. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Mu mbuli, Kristo a haakoti mu nzo a ngooto yi myoho mya baatu myatuunga ve, yi yaakiiba ndulu ifwaani hya mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi. Ka Kristo akoti hu yulu lo mwakulu, hu nde ali mu umonehele ŋa busu bwa Nzambi mu uvolele bisu mileembe. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Pasi ilima, mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wu Bayudaayo, ubaakoto hu mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi, na makila ma maavele ma nde. Ka Kristo a haakoti hu yulu mu uyeholo nde mwakulu nzyeholo yindahi ve. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Tso a buuna ve, kini nde akiimono pasi mono yindahi umata pangili a tsi. Mu mbuli, mu taangu mo yiniiyi, nde ayamonehele monehele limosi, mu tsukusu a taangu, mu umaasa masumu mu nzyehulili a nde mwakulu mu bungodu. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Pasi muutu afwana ukwa kwa limosi, titswene Nzambi tsundisi nde. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Ni bumosi kaka, Kristo baayehuli nde yeholo limosi mu bungodu, mu umaasa masumu ma baatu ba balahi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Esa 53.12</ref></char></note>. Nde uyaamonehele monehele la moole, a husaali mu uyaamaasa masumu ma baatu ve, ka mu uyaafuuhasa boosi ba bali mu ukeele liyobolo mu nziili a nde.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Mikele mya Moose ndulu ifwaani hi mabwe ma hu busu. Ka a imbuli a mbuli hya bi bili ŋaana ve. Ni mu buuna, myo utwala ubita baatu ba bali mu uyaasusaha huli Nzambi, hu bukuhu ve: buni myo mikiitwala uba buuna, tso bali mu uva bungodu bwa tsuhili ni bwo bumosi, pasi ilima nzyen-nzyeni? <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Tso ba bali mu ukuunda Nzambi buuna, baakituhi ba baatsyeme ndulu tsyeme limosi mu masumu ma bo, bo a baakiiheleene mitima mu masumu ma bo ve. Buuna bo a baakiibweva bungodu bu linyahula li masumu ve. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Mu mbuli, mu bungodu bwa tsuhili mo buuna, baatu bali mu uyibuhala moonyi mu masumu ma bo pasi ilima. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Mu tooni ati, makila ma balumi ba bangombe na ma balumi ba bataba, utwala umasa masumu ve.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Ni mu buuna, bu taangu yi Kristo haakiiya mu tsi yaatoodi, nde aleeli huli Nzambi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">«We a haatoondi tso bungodu bwa tsuhili, tso makabu ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">ka we aviidi me nyutu.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />We a haamoni kinya tso mu bibulu ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">bibulu bi baakudasa ŋa diiku li bungodu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">tso mu bungodu bwa tsuhili ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">mu nyahulili masumu.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Buuna me andeeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">“Me ndi mu unza huli we me mwakulu, Nzambi a me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">mu ukuhasa litondo la we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">we bu baasonehe mu tooni a me</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">mu libuuku la Ngidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:7-9">Mkg 40.7-9</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Nde amatswamina uleele bunuubu: «We a haatoondi tso bungodu bwa tsuhili ve, tso bungodu bu makabu ve, tso bungodu bu baakudasa ŋa diiku ve, tso bungodu bwa tsuhili mu nyahulili masumu ve, na we a haamoni kinya mu biina ve.» Bungodu bwa tsuhili mo buuna, baakava bwo we bu hu li Mikele. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Titswene nde abweleele: «Me aka mu unza me mwakulu mu uyaakuhasa litondo la we.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:9">Nde miifwinzala bikuundili byatsomi mu ukiisa bi binyatihi. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Yisu Kristo akuhisi litondo la Nzambi. Nde ayehuli nde mwakulu yeholo limosi nzyeni, mu utsyemese bisu mu masumu ma bisu.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyahulili masumu na usupaha hwa mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Pasi ngaanga a Nzambi ubaateleme pasi ilumbu, mu usa isalu hya nde. Nde ubaayeholo bungodu bwa tsuhili pasi taangu, bungodu mo buuna, utwala unyahula masumu ma baatu ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Pal 29.38</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Ka Kristo, amiiyeholo bungodu ndulu yeholo limosi nzyeni mu nyahulili masumu. Titswene, nde amiiyatsahala nzyeni ŋa mbahala a Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Bunuubu, nde li mu ukeele ti Nzambi asuusa baboho ba nde hu tsina a miilu mya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Ni mu buuna, ndulu mu piili a kabu limosi, nde abiti baatu ba nde haatsyemisi mu masumu, hu usupaha hwa nzyeni.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Livupu la Ngidi kaka lili mu usilasa bisu lo na lili mu uleele:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />«Mono nzuhisini yi me utsa na bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">hu mbisa a bilumbu mo biina, buleeli Pfumu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">me utsonehe Mikele mya me mu mitima mya bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">me ukiratana myo mu matsimi ma bo.»<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Na nde li mu ubwese bunuubu: «Me a humbwenzibuhala moonyi mu masumu ma bo, tso mu mambu ma bo ma mabi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33-34">Yel 31.33-34</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa hu li nyahulili masumu, a husaali na tsoongo mu ubweva makabu mu nyahulili masumu ve.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ususaha huli Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Buuna, baana ba ngu, bisu a benu laaka na bunyanga bu ukoto hu mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi, mu nzila yi makila ma Yisu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Nde amiidibula bisu nzila yi nyatihi na ya moonyi, mu uvyohele mu nguumbu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nguumbu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ni tsanda yi yaakakaba mbuha ya ngidi na mbuha yi yaafulala bungidi hutso a nzo a ngooto hu tsi a nzala, na mu nzo lisambulu ya Yeruselemi.</char></note>, ni nyutu a nde mwakulu. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Bunuubu, bisu lika na mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi wu bamiibyalisa mutumi a nzo a Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Ni mu buuna, lisusahaani huli Nzambi, na mutima wu imbuli, na imiinu hi hyakuha, na mutima wu atsyeme mu matsimi ma mabi, na nyutu yi baaswaha mu mamba ma maatsyeme<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezk 36.25</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Lihwadaani na mifudi mu ukaanga hiitu hi lili mu uta ibila, mu tooni ati, Nzambi li ngetetee mu malahi ma nde. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Likumbasanaani mu uhwadasana mu usinzatondo, na usalila mavaanga ma mabwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Linyahaani utiimba mapfuutini ma bisu, we bu hu li ipfu hya baatu bakima. Ka laafwana ubaahwadasana. Mu tooni a bu lili mu umono ti ilumbu hya Pfumu hyaka bebele.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Ni mbuli, hu mbisa uyaaba imbuli hyoosi, tso bisu lili mu ukwilala mu usumaha mu usa ukana, a husaali na bungodu bwa tsuhili bu buutwala umaasa masumu ve. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Husaali huli bisu ndulu ka ni mu ukeele na tsisu, tsundusu a Nzambi na mbaahu yinene yi yiunyengese bambene ba nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Esa 26.11</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Woosi wu uvelekiinza Mikele mya Moose, sa baduba nde hwavele ukwila nde lingebe, tso bambangi boole buuve batatu batiidi imbangi mu bubi bwa nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Pfu 19.15</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Ka buni buuba mu nde wuuna wu ubaarokolo Mwana a Nzambi, wu ubaatsima ti makila ma nzuhisini, ma maafutili inoongi hya nde na Nzambi, a mali na tsoongo ve, na wu ubaatuha Livupu li libaava hyese? Tsimaani ki pila a tsyembili yuuhwama na nde! <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Mu mbuli, bisu liyaabi nde wuuna wu aleele bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">«Mufutili a piinga me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">me ni wu utsyende pasi muutu».</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:30">Titswene nde abweleele bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">«Pfumu sa atsundasa baatu ba nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35-36">Pfu 32.35-36</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Ni dyambu la tsisu mu ubwa ŋa myoho mya Nzambi a moonyi!<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Ka yibuhalaani moonyi mu ma benu laabwani na mo hutsomi. Mu bilumbu mo biina, hu mbisa uyaka liyalala la Nzambi, benu laakuundi mapasi, benu laavaangini mu iteesi hi inono. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Bakima mu benu baayaki bituhi na baanyongisi bo ŋa kuungi la baatu. Taangu kima, bakima baakahwadisa ba baakayaka bituhi na ba baakaba mu munyongi. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Benu laamoni mapasi itwadi na bikondaayi. Bu baapatuli busina bwa benu, benu laasiingi na kinya ti bapatula busina bya benu, bu benu laaba laayaaba ti benu na busina bu bwafulala bubwe, bu bubaadiinga taangu yoosi. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Ni mu buuna, a lipatusa hiitu hya benu ve, mu tooni ati, hyo na musyendo wu munene. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Buuna, benu na nzala mukonono mu ukuhasa litondo la Nzambi, na uyaka biina bi nde haamiisila benu lahi. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Mu mbuli, baasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">«Ka ndulu mwana a taangu hoole, yi yaafulala hoole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">na wu afwana uya, sa aya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">nde a huutaamba ve.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Woosi wu li tsiitsa ŋa busu bwa me uba moonyi mu imiinu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">ka nde afutaha mbisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">me a umono kinya mu nde ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:3-4">Hab 2.3-4</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Bisu a lili ba bubaafutaha mbisa, na udimbala ve. Bisu lili baatu ba nga imiinu na ba bali mu nzila liyobolo.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Usa imiinu mu Nzambi, ni uba na hiitu mu bisiha bi libaatsima uyaka, ni usilasa hu bisiha bi laavelemono. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Ni mu imiinu hya bo, Nzambi haasilisi babahala na bakaasu ba taangu a tsikulu.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Ni mu imiinu, bisu libaayaaba ti tsi yoosi baavaanga mu mambu ma Nzambi, na byosi bi bibaamonehele, baavaangi byo mu bi bibaavelemonehele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1">Mba 1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Mkg 33.6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Ni mu imiinu, Abeli haayehuli huli Nzambi bungodu bu bwalutahala bwa Kayini bubwe. Ni mu imiinu Nzambi haatili Abeli imbangi ti nde li muutu wu akuha, bu Nzambi nde mwakulu haasilisi makabu ma nde. Ni mu imiinu hya nde, Abeli akini mu utoyo, tso bu nde haamiikwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Mba 4.3-10</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Ni mu imiinu, Nzambi haavinguli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">haavinguli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Umaasa muutu ŋa hati la baatu mu maviingu.</char></note> Enooke hu yulu, hwavele umono lipfu. Muutu tso mumosi a haabwemono nde ve, mu tooni ati, Nzambi avinguli nde. Mu mbuli, teehele nde avingula nde, Nzambi asilisi nde bu nde haaba muutu wu mubwe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:24">Mba 5.24</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Ka hwavele imiinu, muutu utwala uva Nzambi kinya ve. Mu mbuli, woosi wu uyaasusaha huli Nzambi, afwana usa imiinu ti Nzambi li, na ti nde ubaasyende ba bali mu usaha nde.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Ni mu imiinu, Nowa ayuhi makebisili ma Nzambi, mu mambu ma maakiivangama, ma baabeedi kini a baamoni ve. Nowa asiingili Nzambi na atuungi likuumbi li laafuuhisi nde na nzo a nde yoosi. Ni mu buuna mu imiinu, nde haabelisi toto yoosi yi nde haabyalili, na Nzambi amoni nde muutu wu akuha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Mba 6.13-22</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Ni mu imiinu, Abrahami haasiingili Nzambi ŋa Nzambi haateeli nde. Nde ayeni hu tsi yi Nzambi haasiidi lahi mu uva nde we mukobe. Nde ayeni hwavele uyaaba hu nde haakayene. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Ni mu imiinu, nde haatsahili we mwenyi hu tsi yi Nzambi haasiidi nde lahi. Nde atsahili hutso a nzo a ngooto, bumosi kaka we Isaki na Yakobi ba baakituhi bo baboole babyalili ba mukobe a lahi ni lo limosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Mba 12.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 23:4">23.4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:12">35.12</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 35:27">27</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ka Abrahami akakeele musyenge nga bibeene bi byavangama, musyenge wu Nzambi nde mwakulu ali musuundi na mutuungi.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Ni mu imiinu kaka Sara, tso bu haaba inguma na bu haaba haaka inunu mu umene yimi, Nzambi aviidi nde matwala ma ubaha imbisa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Mba 18.11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21.2</ref></char></note>. Mu mbuli, nde aba na hiitu ti lahi li Nzambi haasiidi nde luuvangama. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ni mu buuna, mu muutu mumosi, Abrahami inunu wu aba aka hu manili idiingu hya nde ŋa toto, hwapali imbisa hi ilahi, we bamvwelele hu mayulu, baapfunana we musyeŋunyu ŋa simu li mubu, wu buuveletwala utanga<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Mba 22.17</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Ni hutso imiinu, baatu mo baana boosi baakwidi. Bo a baabahi bi Nzambi haasiidi bo lahi ve. Ka bo baatalili byo hu lala na baamoni kinya mu byo. Bo baabanguli ti bo baaba byenyi na bapyohi-nzila ŋa toto<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Mba 23.4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1Mi 29.15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:13">Mkg 39.13</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Bu bo baabanguli buuna, bo bali mu umweese paayalala ti bo bali mu usaha tsi yi yiuba ya bo mwakulu. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Tso bo baanyongi mu tsi yi bo baamati mu yo, bo baakibaha nzila mu ufutaha huuna. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Mu mbuli, bo baaba na nzala a tsi yi yaafulala tsi mo yiniiyi bubwe. Tsi mo, ni tsi ya hu mayulu. Ni mu buuna, Nzambi a hali na tsonyi bu bali mu uteele nde Nzambi a bo ve. Eye, nde aba amiivangimasa bo musyenge.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Ni mu imiinu, Abrahami haayehuli Isaki mu bungodu, ŋa Nzambi haayebi mutima a nde. Eye, nde aba avangama mu uyeholo mwana a nde wu livingu, mu tooni a bu nde haayaki lahi mu nde. <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Nzambi aleeli nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 11:18">«Ni mu Isaki we ubaha imbisa hi me atsa we lahi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Mba 22.1-14</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Ka Abrahami ayaabi ti Nzambi na matwala ma usuula Isaki mu babaakwa. Ni mu buuna, Nzambi haafutili nde mwana a nde: Vanga mo liniili, lili ifwaani hya sahu.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Mu imiinu, Isaki asyemi Yakobi na Esawu mu libwe la bo la hu busu.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Ni mu imiinu, Yakobi haasyemi pasi mwana a Yosefi, bu nde haaba bebele mu ukwa. Nde asikimi mu tsoso likaanda la nde na nde akuundi Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Mba 27.27-29</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:39-40">39-40</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Ni mu imiinu, Yosefi, hu pedu a tsukusu idiingu hya nde, haayabisi palili a baana ba Isereli mu Ngipiti, na nde aleeli bo bu bo buusa mu mavisi ma nywutu a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">Mba 50.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Pal 13.19</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Ni mu imiinu, babuti ba Moose baaswehi nde mu batsungi batatu, hu mbisa a mbutili a nde. Bu baamoni ti nde aba mubwe a mwana, bo a baabati boomo mu ubisala tumili a mutumi a tsi ve.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Ni mu imiinu, bu Moose amiibuuha, nde abisi ti bateele nde mwana a mwana a Falahoni wu mukaasu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:22">Pal 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 2:2">2.2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Nde asiingi hwa nde umono mapasi itwadi na buli la Nzambi, ka a mu umono makinya ma tsumihili mu mwana a taangu hoole ve. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Nde atsimi ti, tsonyi yi nde haamoni bu nde haasiingi Masiya, yaaba yaafulala tsoongo na busina bwa Ngipiti. Ka nde akatalila musyendo wa hu busu.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Ni mu imiinu, Moose haamati Ngipiti, hwavele ubata boomo bwa kesi a mutumi. Nde amweesi mukami, we nde wu akamono Nzambi wu baavelemono. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Ni mu imiinu, nde haavangimisi mukungi a Paake na haatumi mu ukila makila mu mapatu ma manzo, mana pofi mudubi aveleduba bapasa-mabeelo ba babahala ba bisu Isereli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Ni mu imiinu, baana ba Isereli baasabuhi mubu wu mubeenge, we ŋa yulu a toto a banga. Ka ŋa masadaadu ma Ngipiti maayehili usa bumosi, bo baadyami<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:15">Pal 2.15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">12.21-30</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Ni mu imiinu, bibaha bi byakadiinga musyenge a Yeriko byabwidi, hu mbisa a hu baana ba Isereli baadyengili byo mu bilumbu tsambu. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Ni mu imiinu, Rahabi, imbembo hi mukaasu, hyavelikwa itwadi na ba baakavelesa imiinu mu Nzambi, mu tooni ati, hyo hyaayaki baketi ba musyenge mu hyenze<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:23">Yos 6.23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Yos 2.1-21</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Ki lo me umbwendeele? Tangu a yiubweba ve mu utoyele mu Ngedehoni, Barake, Samusoni, Yefite, Davidi, Samweli, na mimbihuli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:11">Bnz 6.11</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6">4.6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:24">13.24</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1">11.1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 12:7">12.7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:45">1Sa 17.45</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:20">1Sa 12.20</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Mu tooni imiinu, bo baabiingili matsi ma batumi, bo baasalili butsiitsa, na baayaki bi Nzambi haasiidi lahi. Bo baadibuhi minywa mi bakosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:6">Bnz 14.6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:34">1Sa 17.34</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:23">Dan 6.23</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />Bo baadimisi mambaahu ma mifudi, baafuuhi mu lipfu la sabila. Hu mbisa bubeedu, bo baabahi mifudi; bo baamonihili balwani ba tsisu hutso midiingu na baabingisi makonge ma balwani ma byenyi. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Bakaasu baamoni bamvumbi ba bo mu usuuha mu babaakwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6">Dan 6</ref></char></note>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Baanyongisi bakima mu iteesi hi lipfu. Bo baabisi ti bafuuhasa bo, mana bo basuuha mu babaakwa na babaha idiingu hi hyalutahala bubwe. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Bakima kaka baakuundi mukwede na bikooti, bamosi baahadi mapaanga na baabwahi bo mu kondaayi. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Bamosi baadubi mu mamanya, bakima baatabuli mu bitudu byole mu bikwakwa, buuve baadubi mu sabila. Bakima kaka baakayene mutele-mutele, baalwata bikutu bi baatuunga mu bibaanda bi mandombo, buuve bi bataba. Hutso buyaha, baakatsuta na baakakwamisa bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26-27">1Pf 22.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25-26">2Mi 18.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Yel 20.2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37.15</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Tsi a yaaba a yaahwama na baatu mo baana ve! Bo baakayene mutele-mutele mu makumu ma nzala na mu yulu bisyelo. Bo baakatsahala mutso mirali, na mutso biyuna bya mu toto.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Nzambi asilisi baatu mo baana boosi mu tooni imiinu hya bo. Ka bo a baayaki bi Nzambi haasiidi bo lahi ve. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Eye, Nzambi ataasili bisu mu bisiha bi byafulala bubwe, na nde a haatoondi ve ti bo bato hu usupaha hwavele a bisu.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi Taata a bisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Uto ti bisu, koonge yinene yi bambangi mo baniiba, yaadiinga bisu. Ni mu buuna, litiimbaani byosi bi bibaalemese dwe la bisu, fula-fula masumu ma maasinzakangama mu bisu. Na libataani tiinu na mukonono, mu uvaangana hwa tiinu ya ŋa busu bwa bisu. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Lisungamanaani Yisu, wu li mbandihili imiinu hya bisu, na wu li mu utoose hyo hu usupaha. Ŋa mbuha makinya ma baasuusi ŋa busu bwa nde, nde akuundi lipfu ŋa kuruwa, hwavele umono tsonyi mu lipfu la pila mo yiina. Na bunuubu, nde amiitsahala ŋa mbahala a kiti-ipfumu ya Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Tsimaani buni nde haakami mutima ŋa busu bwa baatu ba baasumaha, ba baatelimini nde, mana benu a likolo na a lifutaha mbisa. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Mu tooni ati, mu mudiingu a benu ŋa busu bu masumu, benu kini a laamaalwana natee lipfu ve. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Benu laamiivusahana kwadisili yi Nzambi haahwadisa benu, we huli baana ba nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">«Mwana a me, a nyasula tsuungihili yi Pfumu ali mu usuungaha we ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">na a kolese binama ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">ŋa nde ali mu usyembe we.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Mu tooni ati, Pfumu ubaasuungaha wu nde haatondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">nde ubaatete bikooti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">huli woosi wu nde ubaasilasa ti mwana a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Mak 3.11-12</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Kamaani mutima mu mapasi ma Nzambi ali mu usuungaha benu. Mu mbuli, Nzambi ubaavolo benu we baana ba nde. Ki mwana wu taata haavelesuungaha? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Tso a basuungihi benu we bu bali mu usuungaha baana ba nde boosi ve, buuna benu a lili baana ba mbuli ve. Ka benu lili baana ba bitswadi. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Liyibuhalaani moonyi mu bataata ba bisu ba ŋa toto: bo baakasuungaha bisu, na bisu laakakiinza bo. Tandisini a Taata a bisu wa hu mayulu! Bisu laafwana uba hu tsina lituma la nde, mana liyakaani moonyi mu nde. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Bataata ba bisu baakasuungaha bisu mu mwana a taangu hoole, we bu bo baakatondo. Ka, mu libwe la bisu, Nzambi li mu usuungaha bisu, mana bisu liba bangidi we nde. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Ŋa bisu limiiyaka matsuungihili, bisu libaakoto mu lingebe, kini a mu kinya ve. Ka hu busu, ba baamiiyiha tsuungihili mo yiina, bubaayaka kaluha: kaluha ni hyenze hi hyabaambana na idiingu hi hyahwama na litondo la Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matumili na manzibusili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Ni mu buuna: Hwadisaani myoho mya benu mi myaamiikolo, na maboongo ma benu ma mali mu utehete! <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Kotwaani mu misoho mi myasungama<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Mak 4.26</ref></char></note>, mana huulu hwa tsode a hubangumana, ka hwo hubeeloho.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Hwadaani mu uba mu hyenze na baatu boosi, napa mu bungidi; tso a mu bwo ve, muutu utwala umono Pfumu ve. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Kebaani mana muutu tso mumosi a haveleyaka hyese hya Nzambi. Kebaani mana muutu tso mumosi a hakituha linganzi li unyongese bana. Kebaani mana muutu tso mumosi a hakituha linganzi la kali, li luukula na ubiiyasa baatu ba balahi ŋa hati la benu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:17">Pfu 29.17</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Kebaani mana muutu tso mumosi mu benu a hadyata hutso bumbembo. Kebaani mana muutu tso mumosi mu benu a hapenye bisiha bya ngidi, we Esawu wu asuumbisi bukuutu bwa nde mu mwana a byudya. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Benu liyaabi ti hu busu, nde atoondi uyaka lisyeme la taata a nde, ka baanyasuli nde. Nde a haatwali usobo dyambu mo liina ve, tso bu nde haayehili usaha ubwefutahala bukuutu bwa nde hutso bililu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Mba 25.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">27.30-40</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Benu a laayidi ŋa pedu bisiha bi baatu buutwala ubeembe ve: tso na mbaahu yi yibaakudasa, tso na butsuhu, tso na piipidi ya dunga-dunga, tso na mvula muhuunga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">muhuunga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ifula hiinene.</char></note>, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />tso na munyingu a kulambeete, tso na munyingu a ndaha mosi. Ŋa bisu Isereli baayuhi ndaha mo yiina, bo baavondi ti bo babweveleyuha ndaha mo yiina<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Pal 19.16-22</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Ka bo a baakuundi tumili mo yiniiyi ve: «Pasi muutu wu ubeembe isyelo, tso hyaba ibulu, sa baduba nde mu mamanya.» <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Ma bo baamoni, maaba ma boomo bu bwafulala ŋa Moose haaleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:21">«Me ndi mu utehete, bu me ndi mutso a boomo bu bwafulala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Pal 19.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:19">Pfu 9.19</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ka benu laayidi ŋa pedu isyelo hya Syoni, na ŋa pedu musyenge a Nzambi a moonyi: ni Yeruselemi ya hu yulu, na biveeve bi bapofi ba nde. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Benu laayidi ŋa pedu a pfuutini yi mukungi. Mukungi bapasa-mabeelo ba babahala ba Nzambi, ba manduhi baasonehe hu mayulu. Benu laayidi ŋa pedu a Nzambi, mutsundisi a baatu boosi, na biluunzi bya baatu ba tsiitsa, ba baamiito hu bukuhu. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Benu laayidi ŋa pedu a Yisu, sabu la nzuhisini yi nyatihi, na li makila ma nde, ma maasupihini, ma mali mu utoyo bubwe, ufulala makila ma Abeli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Mba 4.10</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Ni mu buuna, kebaani! A libisa uyuhala wu li mu uyambila huli benu ve. Ba baabisi uyuhala wu akayibusa bo ŋa toto<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:22">Pal 20.22</ref></char></note>, baayaki tsyembili. Tandisini a bisu, sa buba bumosi kaka, tso bisu litunihili wu li mu uyibusa bisu umata hu mayulu. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Hutsomi, ndaha a Nzambi yaanyingisi toto. Ka lolo yiniiyi, nde li mu usa bisu lahi mo liniili:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:26">«Me unyingasa toto nyingasa likima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:26">a ndulu toto ve, ka napa yulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Age 2.6</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Bunuubu, bikuma bya we «nyingasa likima», bitoondi uleele ti bisiha bi Nzambi haavaanga, byutsaamuha na byudimbala, mana ndulu bi byuveletsaamuha bikwilala.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ni mu buuna, libaafutalaani matondo huli Nzambi, mu tooni ati bisu a benu lili mu uyaka Ipfumu hi hyuveletsaamuha. Limweesaani pfutilili matondo mo yiina mu ukuunda Nzambi bu hwafwana, hutso butsitu na boomo bwa nde. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi a bisu li mbaahu yi yibaakudasa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Pfu 4.24</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Umweese kinya huli Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Kwilalaani hutso litondo li bumwana bu bungu. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />A livusahana usalila nzakili yimbwe ya byenyi ve; mu tooni ati, mu nzakili mo yiina, bakima baayaki bapofi hwavele uyaaba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Mba 18.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19.1-3</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Yibuhalaani moonyi mu bikondaayi, we benu ba lili bikondaayi na bo. Yibuhalaani moonyi mu ba bali mu unyongese, mu tooni ati, benu kaka lili na nyutu yi buutwala unyongese. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Nyaha pasi muutu abaakiinza makwele, na taangi makwele yivele na tsumihili. Nzambi utsundasa baatu ba bubaadyata hutso bumbembo na ba bubaasalila mayamba.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Nyaha ndyatili a benu yivelesiingama mu toti a mbongo. Siŋanaani ndulu mu bi benu lili na byo. Mu tooni ati, Nzambi nde mwakulu aleele: «Me a utsiisa we ve, na me a umbila utiimba we ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Pfu 31.6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1">Yos</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Ni mu buuna, bisu luutwala usilasa na ibahala:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">«Pfumu ni mukuumbisi a me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">me a umba na boomo tso hoole ve!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Hima muutu huutwala usa me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Mkg 118.6</ref> </char></note>?»<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Yibuhalaani moonyi mu ba baatumi benu, ba baalongisi benu mambu ma Nzambi. Tsimaani mu ndyatili a bo na mu tsukusu idiingu hya bo, na duukalaani imiinu hya bo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yisu Kristo li ni nde mumosi, matsiha, lolo yiniiyi, na mu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Kebaani udunga mu mandongisili ma maasobohono na ma benu laayaki. Hwafwana mu uhwadisa mutima mu hyese hya Nzambi, ka a mu mikele mi mili mu utala byudya ve. Ba bali mu usalila mikele mo miina, a bali mu ubaha kaluha mu myo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:8">Yel 29.8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 14:2-23">Lom 14.2-23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:8">1Ko 8.8</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:16-22">Kol 2.16-22</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 4:3">1Ti 4.3</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Bangaanga ba Nzambi ba bubaasala hu mbuha ya ngidi, a bali na muswa mu udya bi baayeholo ŋa diiku la tsuhili bungodu ve. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, ubaabehe makila ma bibulu hu mbuha yi yaalutahala bungidi, mu uyeholo mo we bungodu mu linyahula li masumu; ka bubaatsuha nyutu bibulu mo biina hu mbadi itsaka<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Lev 16.27</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Ni mu buuna, Yisu kaka haakwidi hu mbadi musyenge<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:17">Yow 19.17</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:20">20</ref> </char></note>, mana mu makila ma nde mwakulu, nde abyalisa baatu mu isalu hya Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Buuna, tswendaani huli nde hu mbadi itsaka, na ukuunda muroko wu nde haakuundi. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Mu tooni ati, ŋa toto ŋaniiŋa, bisu a lili na musyenge wu ubaakwilala ve. Bisu ubaasaha musyenge wu li mu uya. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Nyaha, mu Yisu, bisu a benu libaava muyusu huli Nzambi taangu yoosi we bungodu, mbindulili ni ti: Bungodu bu mikuma bu bibodu bya bisu a benu, bili mu uyuusa nduhi a nde ŋa kuungi la baatu.<verse eid="HEB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />A livusahana uvaanga libwe, na ubaakumbasana mu bumwana bu bungu. Mu tooni ati, buuna ni bungodu bu bubaamweese Nzambi kinya.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Siingalaani batumi ba benu, na kulamanaani hu tsina lituma la bo. Mu tooni ati, bo bali mu ukeelese benu taangu yoosi, bu bo baayaaba ti, bo sa bava ikuumbu huli Nzambi. Likumbasaani bo mana bo babaasa isalu hya bo na kinya yoosi, ka a na miyayiini ve. Liina a luuva benu kaluha tso mosi ve.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Sambilaani mu bisu! Bisu lili na hiitu ti mitima mya bisu mili na matsimi ma mabwe, na laamiivolo kesili yi ubaaba na mbiili yimbwe mu pasi dyambu. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Titswene, me pondi huli benu mu usambila bulahi mana Nzambi adibula me nzila, mu ufutaha huli benu mu mawasa.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lisambulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Nzambi, wu ubaava hyenze, asuula Pfumu a bisu Yisu ŋa hati la babaakwa. Nde aka keedi a mameme wu munene, mu nzila yi makila ma nde ma mali mu usilasa nzuhisini yi bilima na bilima. <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Nyaha Nzambi mo wunuuwu ava benu matwala ma uvaanga moosi ma mabwe, mana benu likuhasa litondo la nde; mana nde avaanga mu bisu ma mu umweese nde kinya, mu itwadi na Yisu Kristo wu akuha mu uyaka muyusu wu bilima na bilima! Amen!<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manili muhanda na mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Me pondi huli benu baana ba ngu, mu ukama mutima, mu uyuha mambu ma kwadisili maniima. Napa ma me miitsonehe, a mali hwa mo ma mala ve. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Yaabaani ti mwana a ngu a bisu Timoteho banyahula mu kondaayi. Tso nde lengi na yaato, me unzaamono benu itwadi na nde.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Tooselaani mabwehe huli batumi ba benu boosi, na huli bangidi boosi. Baana ba ngu ba hu tsi a Italiya bamiitsindaha benu mabwehe ma bo.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Nyaha hyese hya Nzambi hiba na benu boosi!<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>